# Ensemble UI Frontend Rules

## Technology Stack
- **React 19** with functional components and hooks
- **Vite 7** for build and dev server
- **Redux Toolkit** for state management
- **React-Bootstrap 2** + **Bootstrap 5** for UI components
- **Tailwind CSS 4** + **SASS** for styling
- **Vitest** + **React Testing Library** for tests

## Project Structure
```
frontend/
├── src/
│   ├── components/    # React components (PascalCase.jsx)
│   ├── services/      # API client (api.js)
│   ├── store/         # Redux (store.js, agentSlice.js)
│   └── test/          # Test setup
├── public/            # Static assets
└── dist/              # Build output
```

## Code Conventions

### Component Patterns
- Functional components with hooks (no class components)
- File naming: `ComponentName.jsx`
- Destructure props at function signature
- Use `useState`, `useEffect`, `useRef` from React

### State Management
- Redux Toolkit patterns with `createSlice`
- API calls in `src/services/api.js`
- Local component state for UI-only concerns

### Styling
- Dark theme colors:
  - Background: `#1a1d29`
  - Cards: `#242836`
  - Borders: `#3a3f52`
  - Text: `#e4e6eb`
  - Muted text: `#9ca3af`
- Prefer inline styles for component-specific styling
- Use Bootstrap utilities for layout
- Tailwind for utility classes when needed

## Key Components

| Component | Purpose |
|-----------|---------|
| `App.jsx` | Main orchestrator, polling, view switching |
| `ActivityFeed.jsx` | Real-time activity log |
| `AgentHierarchyTree.jsx` | Visual agent tree |
| `AgentStatusPane.jsx` | Active agent details |
| `MetricsDashboard.jsx` | Token usage and costs |
| `PendingQuestions.jsx` | Q&A interface |
| `GeneratedFiles.jsx` | File list and viewer |

## API Integration

### Service Functions (src/services/api.js)
```javascript
import { generateSolution, getRecentActivities, ... } from './services/api';
```

### Polling Pattern
```javascript
useEffect(() => {
  const timer = setInterval(fetchActivityData, pollInterval);
  return () => clearInterval(timer);
}, [pollInterval, isPaused]);
```

### WebSocket (backup)
```javascript
const ws = new WebSocket('ws://localhost:8001/ws/agent-status');
```

## Testing

### Run Tests
```bash
npm run test          # Run once
npm run test:ui       # Interactive UI
npm run test:coverage # With coverage
```

### Test Files
- `*.test.jsx` alongside components
- Use `@testing-library/react` for rendering
- jsdom environment configured in `vitest.config.js`

## Build & Development

```bash
npm run dev      # Start dev server (port 5173)
npm run build    # Production build to dist/
npm run lint     # ESLint validation
```

## Common Gotchas

- Backend must be running on port 8001 for API calls
- Promise.all for parallel API fetches on initial load
- Filter state managed locally, not in Redux
- Collapsible sections use local `useState`
- Badge colors: warning=running, success=completed, danger=failed
